{"id":"n1-012","title":"A のやら B のやら (A no yara B no yara)","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Used when the speaker is unsure or confused between multiple possibilities.","longExplanation":"The A のやら B のやら grammar expresses the speaker's confusion or inability to decide between possibility A and B. It can be translated roughly as 'whether it's A or B (I don't know).'","formation":"Noun1 + のやら + Noun2 + のやら (also works with adjectives and verbs + のやら)","examples":[{"jp":"彼が怒っているのやら、悲しいのやら、私には分からない。","romaji":"Kare ga okotte iru no yara, kanashii no yara, watashi ni wa wakaranai.","en":"I don't know whether he's angry or sad.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"怒っ","vocabId":"1445690","reading":"おこる","baseForm":"怒る"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いる","vocabId":"1577980","reading":"いる"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"やら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"悲しい","vocabId":"1483190","reading":"かなしい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"やら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"分から","vocabId":"1606560","reading":"わかる","baseForm":"分かる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,9,10]},{"jp":"試験の結果が良いのやら悪いのやら、気になって仕方がない。","romaji":"Shiken no kekka ga yoi no yara warui no yara, ki ni natte shikata ga nai.","en":"I can’t help worrying whether my exam results are good or bad.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"結果","vocabId":"1254690","reading":"けっか"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"良い","vocabId":"1605820","reading":"よい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"やら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"悪い","vocabId":"1151260","reading":"わるい"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"やら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"気","vocabId":"1221520","reading":"き"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"なる"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕方","vocabId":"1594110","reading":"しかた"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":"2098290","reading":"ない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5,6,8,9]},{"jp":"彼女が私を好きなのやら嫌いなのやら、わからない。","romaji":"Kanojo ga watashi o suki na no yara kirai na no yara, wakaranai.","en":"I don’t know whether she likes me or hates me.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"好き","vocabId":"1277450","reading":"すき"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"やら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"嫌い","vocabId":"1257240","reading":"きらい"},{"surface":"な","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"やら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"わから","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"わかる"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6,7,10,11]},{"jp":"彼が本当に行くのやら行かないのやら、はっきりしない。","romaji":"Kare ga hontou ni iku no yara ikanai no yara, hakkiri shinai.","en":"It’s unclear whether he will really go or not.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本当に","vocabId":"1611580","reading":"ほんとうに"},{"surface":"行く","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"やら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行か","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく","baseForm":"行く"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"の","vocabId":"1537250","reading":"の"},{"surface":"やら","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":nul